! CAM-B3LYP def2-TZVPD AutoAux RIJCOSX TightSCF
# Gauge diagnostic for the transition dipole.
# STEOM at def2-SVPD gives f(length) 0.849 vs f(velocity) 1.283 -- a 1.51x
# disagreement that GREW from 1.34x at def2-SVP. Length and velocity must agree
# for an exact wavefunction in a complete basis, so either the basis is
# inadequate for the transition moment or the STEOM moment itself is unreliable.
# TDDFT at the same geometry and bases separates those: if TDDFT's gauges agree
# where STEOM's do not, the method is implicated, not the basis.
%maxcore 4000
%pal nprocs 6 end
%pointcharges "field.pc"
%tddft
  NRoots 5
  TDA false
end
* xyzfile -1 1 geom_cthrp.xyz
